WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:05.230
<b>A gathering storm.</b>

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:07.200
You, too?

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.280
<b>A messenger
 of destruction.</b>

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.240
<b>The archer.</b>

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.300
Y-You can't be...

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:54.150
Y-You can't be...

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.230
Keep your head down.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:08.220
Ryou'un, are you also...

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.200
Silence.

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:10.980
Shuusou, where is the enemy?

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:14.780
There.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.710
It's Sousei after all.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:19.570
Where is his lord?

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.920
Somewhere close, probably.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:24.620
What's this?

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.110
The Kai Card of the Hakkejin?

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.950
We finally meet,

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.200
girl of the Southern Palace.

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:45.100
You put yourself in danger 
for small fry like this?

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:52.100
All the effort you put into 
hiding was wasted, wasn't it?

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.250
It's my fault?

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.500
Is that true, Ryou'un?

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.010
Are you a servant of Kentei?

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:01.860
Indeed.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:04.100
I am Hakuanshi.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:06.870
I brainwashed a teacher

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:10.520
and used him as an agent to find you.

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:14.480
I didn't expect such a beautiful girl

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.540
to be protecting the Southern Palace, though.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:17.940
<i>Protecting?</i>

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:21.130
I'm truly astonished.

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:27.010
Now tell me the location 
of the Southern Palace!

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.520
And if I refuse?

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.520
You think you've got a choice?

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.020
The next strike will show no mercy.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.050
Shuusou.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.160
Do it.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.470
I've been waiting.

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.190
Can you swim?

00:03:58.160 --> 00:03:59.690
Y-Yeah.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:00.420
Then...

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:13.580
You're wasting your time.

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.940
Strike them when they poke 
their heads out of the water.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.290
No hitting the girl.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.940
Now, who'll come up first?

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.650
Zanroutou!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:35.870
<b>Zanroutou</b>

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:37.750
What?

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.760
Not bad.

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.220
Take deep breaths.

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:55.980
If your breathing is that uneven,

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:59.270
it will take time for your spiritual 
power to replenish itself.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:03.280
Is that Hakuanshi guy 
working with Chou-sensei?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:06.150
He's on a whole different level than Sensei.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.280
His spiritual power is beyond compare.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:13.540
But you came to save me anyway, didn't you?

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:15.840
Thank you.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.900
If you hadn't come, I would be...

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.160
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:25.350
I'm here because Suikyou-sensei 
ordered me to come.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:26.800
Now let's go.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:28.380
Before more pursuers arrive.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:29.770
Already?

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.560
We'll run out of the school.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.700
Follow us, please.

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.470
Wait!

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.030
Where are we going?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.820
I'll explain when we get there.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.980
If you want to live, then run!

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.820
You don't like me, do you?

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.830
You don't have to be in such a hurry to flee.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:55.580
When did he...

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.730
He's unarmed.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:00.580
If we attack now...

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.370
Be careful.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.340
He should still be hiding something.

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:08.300
The girl of the Southern Palace is smart.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.380
Teifu of Go!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.360
I shall be your opponent.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.860
<i>He's got two generals?</i>

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:29.100
If it isn't Kan'u-dono's tea servant?

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:31.500
If you're wasting time here,

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.460
Kan'u-dono will scold you again.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:37.960
Well, if it isn't the ancient general of Go.

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:42.130
I had thought you'd retired long ago.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:46.380
Now show me your power.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.160
Don't disappoint me too much.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:50.880
All right.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:55.160
Try to entertain this old man.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.850
Here I come!

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:00.760
Stay there!

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:01.900
Don't move!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.630
R-Right!

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:06.140
<i>I feel an incredible power.</i>

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:08.340
<i>Is this spiritual power?</i>

00:07:24.560 --> 00:07:26.500
What's wrong, Shuusou-dono?

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.760
Is that all you've got?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.260
Then I won't hold back!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.650
Your quite mobile... for your age.

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:51.830
Not bad.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.940
No holding back, then.

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:04.380
Here I go.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.290
Hyappo Zenbai!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.290
<b>Hyappo Zenbai</b>

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.250
He disappeared?

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.670
Shuusou, your right!

00:08:21.490 --> 00:08:25.060
That technique... It's the Hyappo Zenbai!

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.730
Indeed.

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:30.820
A strike capable of piercing the 
heart of an ant outside the Hyappo.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.030
Ryou'un!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.900
I'm fine. Don't worry about me.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:36.880
Poor thing.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:41.140
If you had stayed hidden, 
we wouldn't have found you.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:45.240
Ryou'un, was it?

00:08:46.030 --> 00:08:48.580
It would be a waste to kill you.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:51.880
Join my side, instead.

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:54.880
The world is filled with lies.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:57.580
And the people live like corpses.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:01.210
You don't like this world either, I'm sure.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:06.570
Kentei will revive the Kan dynasty

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:11.340
and revive a society where those 
with the most spiritual power rule.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:16.030
And I need your help for that.

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:20.120
Let us welcome a new era together!

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:19.690
There's a plot like that behind this game?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.620
So you were barely able to 
make me miss your vitals

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.370
because of your lord's warning?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.870
But I won't miss again.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:31.080
The next strike will end your life.

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:33.630
What?

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.380
Got you, Teifu.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:37.880
Now you can't move.

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.520
You...

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:41.850
If you need Hyappo, or a 
hundred steps, to strike,

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.640
then I can stay close to you...

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.900
Damn you!

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:49.400
Is that your answer?

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:53.480
Truly unfortunate.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:57.590
It's your turn, Sousei.

00:10:07.970 --> 00:10:11.320
You never give me a break, huh?

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.190
You look much more handsome now.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.540
Now make them regret

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:23.930
that they disobeyed me.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.560
Gensen Hyuuryuusa!

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:29.810
<b>Gensen Hyuuryuusa</b>

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:34.600
No!

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.210
Ryou'un-sama, get down!

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:43.330
There's nowhere to run!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.120
Shuusou, move!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.620
I can't!

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:01.550
It can't be...

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:06.790
Sonshin?

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:16.740
Well... today's just full
of surprises, isn't it?

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.960
<b>Disaster</b>

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:03.450
The arrows pour down like rain.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.840
Now is the time to break the chains,

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.440
to unleash it.

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.130
A spray of water...

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:10.780
The woman of fire rises...

00:13:10.780 --> 00:13:13.160
Her eyes stare into the jaws of death,

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.070
and a pitch-black darkness approaches.

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.880
Their eyes have little light left.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:19.690
Next time: "Arrowhead."
